## 12. Product governance

No new Omega product, experiment, proof sprint, or paper patch begins without an Obstruction Descent Packet.

**GTOC-7 obligation (Packet bundles):** A paper-level GTOC migration may be a bundle of obstruction packets: one load-bearing descent packet, plus supporting context-exposure packets, plus refusal / oracle packets.
*(To be proved in formal ledger)*

**GTOC-9 obligation (Spatial admission):** Adjacency, order, cover, topology, refinement, geometry, and physical localization remain separate packet fields or derived receipts. The host must not promote an adjacency relation into topology without an order/cover receipt, nor finite topology into metric, manifold, continuum, or locality.

**GTOC-10 obligation (Embodiment and perturbation):** Every embodied/embedded/enacted/extended verdict must name its boundary, coupling, paired intervention, comparison support, and loss ledger. Missing transition law or an unlicensed fifth mode routes to `OracleNeeded` or typed refusal. Perturbation changes no evidence ceiling or authority effect.

