## 15. Open obligations

GTOC-1..10 remain OPEN as theorem obligations in `theorem_ledger.md`. GTOC-1 now has bounded S01-002 Rust execution/replay evidence, which does not close its unrestricted statement. In particular, GTOC-2 (degree-shift invariance) is untouched by the series; the DDA deformation-algebra question (whether licensed Λ-lifts form a monoid, category, operad, or none of these) is unanswered; and terminalizer correctness remains outside this prose spine.

PL-GTOC-1..33 and PL-GTOC-GB1 remain OPEN. The foundation is prose-only: **0 basement Lean targets built**. A future status change requires a fresh bounded goal with the named Lean build, sorry/axiom audit, adversary acceptance, and ground-truth ledger update; this consolidation supplies none of those gates.
